B.ZR=new A.kl(B.e7,"Red Team",B.cT,"GHOSTLOAD","Werewolf","The hooded infiltrator with a rogue USB key.","Every night, together.","Know each other. Each night they silently agree on one employee to compromise. They cannot target a fellow Red Team member.",!1)
B.ZU=new A.kl(B.hX,"Defender",B.aR,"BULWARK","Villager","The frontline guard, shield up.","Never.","No special power. Wins through logic, observation and the vote.",!1)
