B.ZW=new A.kl(B.bZ,"Incident Responder",B.aR,"RESPAWN","Witch","Backup case in one hand, kill switch in the other.","Every night, after the Red Team.","Sees tonight's victim. Two single-use tools: Backup Restore (save the victim) and Kill Process (eliminate any player). Each once per game; they may save themselves.",!0)
B.ZQ=new A.kl(B.dr,"Dead Man's Switch",B.aR,"FAILSAFE","Hunter","Armed, timer at 00:00.","Only when eliminated.","When it goes down, it immediately takes one player of its choice down with it.",!0)
B.ZX=new A.kl(B.ds,"Network Engineer",B.aR,"LINKSMITH","Cupid","Cable on the shoulder, RJ45 in hand.","First night only.","Links two players with a VPN Tunnel. If one goes down, the other goes down too. Linked players never vote against each other.",!0)
